D_{i}g\left(x_{1},x_{2},\ldots,x_{n-1}\right)=-\frac{D_{i}f\left(x_{1},x_{2},\ldots,x_{n}\right)}{D_{n}f\left(x_{1},x_{2},\ldots,x_{n}\right)}
\]




